OL,3,GNEWSARollercoaster looming over homes
OL,4,Adivides opinion
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome residents living in the shadow of
OL,7,Fa prototype rollercoaster that
OL,8,Foverlooks their properties have said
OL,9,Fthey are pleased it may have to be
OL,10,Ftaken down - but others say they will
OL,11,Fmiss it.
OL,13,FThe test ride was erected at a former
OL,14,Faerodrome near Sandford Lane, in
OL,15,FHucknall, Nottinghamshire, in September
OL,16,F2025 but has prompted complaints about
OL,17,Fnoise, visual impact and a loss of
OL,18,Fprivacy.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
