OL,3,GNEWSARollercoaster looming over homes
OL,4,Adivides opinion
OL,5,
OL,6,FAshfield District Council rejected a
OL,7,Fretrospective application by fairground
OL,8,Foperator Mellors Group to use Watnall
OL,9,FRoad site as a rollercoaster testing
OL,10,Fand storage site on 20 October.
OL,12,FIn response, the firm said it would
OL,13,Fappeal against the decision and there
OL,14,Fhad been a "misunderstanding" over the
OL,15,Fpurpose of the site.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
